Phase 1 Frontend Wiring Plan
What We're Building
Four concrete things wired up end-to-end:

Auth UI → Backend — login/signup forms calling /api/auth/* correctly (token stored & used)
POST /api/plans → Supabase — plan service already written; wire the "Save Plan" button to call it with a real token
"Today's Lesson" view — show today's daily target with a "Done" button that posts to POST /api/progress/log with correct schema
Dashboard — streak counter + completion % driven by real API data
