public/index.html
The single file that needs a substantial rewrite of its JavaScript section (lines ~1080–1455) plus minor CSS additions. No new files needed for Phase 1 — everything lives in the vanilla HTML.

Specific fixes:

Fix 1 — Auth token handling
diff

- localStorage.setItem('token', data.token);
+ localStorage.setItem('token', data.session.accessToken);
+ localStorage.setItem('userId', data.user.id);
Fix 2 — markTodaysLessonDone payload
The LogProgressSchema requires: planId, day, sabaqCompleted (bool), sabaqRetentionScore (0-100), sessionDuration (number). Current code sends versesCompleted and misses all required fields.

diff

- body: JSON.stringify({ planId, userId, versesCompleted, day })
+ body: JSON.stringify({
+   planId: currentPlan.id,
+   day: todayDay,
+   sabaqCompleted: true,
+   sabaqRetentionScore: 80,   // default; add slider in next phase
+   sessionDuration: estimatedMinutes,
+ })
Fix 3 — Streak + completion % from API
After logging progress, call GET /api/progress/:planId/stats and render real numbers.

Fix 4 — Today's lesson day calculation
Instead of matching by date string, find the first uncompleted day. Store completed days in localStorage keyed by planId.

Fix 5 — Saved plans list → select plan
selectPlan(plan) should store the full plan_data JSON to currentPlan in localStorage, then refresh today's lesson.

Fix 6 — "Save Plan" button visible after generation + inline in dashboard
After generating, prompt user to save. After saving, the plan becomes the active plan and dashboard opens automatically.

Fix 7 — Dashboard stats panel improvements
Add a progress bar for completion %, flame icon for streak, animated counters.

